      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The dark pill with a product icon, explicit label and small direction glyph.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\" type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M239.89,198.12l-14.26-120a16,16,0,0,0-16-14.12H176a48,48,0,0,0-96,0H46.33a16,16,0,0,0-16,14.12l-14.26,120A16,16,0,0,0,20,210.6a16.13,16.13,0,0,0,12,5.4H223.92A16.13,16.13,0,0,0,236,210.6,16,16,0,0,0,239.89,198.12ZM128,32a32,32,0,0,1,32,32H96A32,32,0,0,1,128,32ZM32,200,46.33,80H80v24a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V80h64v24a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V80h33.75l14.17,120Z\"/></svg><span>가방 자세히 보기</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:50px;padding:0 22px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink,#202423);color:var(--snow,#fff);font-size:13px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:0;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:none}.ds-primary svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ds-primary svg:last-child{width:14px;margin-left:6px}.ds-primary:hover{background:#343a37}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbor,#315845);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary retry action",
