      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "A 44px rounded-square control with a 22px Phosphor asset and accessible label.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"가방 검색\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M229.66,218.34l-50.07-50.06a88.11,88.11,0,1,0-11.31,11.31l50.06,50.07a8,8,0,0,0,11.32-11.32ZM40,112a72,72,0,1,1,72,72A72.08,72.08,0,0,1,40,112Z\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-base-200,#f5f5f7);color:var(--ink,#202423);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,transform 160ms ease}.ds-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ds-icon:hover{background:#e9e9ee}.ds-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbor,#315845);outline-offset:4px;}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-icon:active{transform:scale(.97)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-icon{transition:none}}"
    },
