      "refersTo": "colour-swatch",
      "description": "A catalogue-linked mint sample; the application computes dark or white check colour from actual swatch contrast.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"No.0422 색상 선택\"><button class=\"ds-swatch\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"민트 가방 보기\"><span class=\"ds-swatch-circle\" style=\"--swatch-check:#202423\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"/></svg></span><span>민트</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-picker{display:inline-flex;gap:9px;max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#b4c6bc transparent;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--color-base-200,#f5f5f7)}.ds-swatch{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;flex:0 0 44px;min-width:44px;min-height:64px;padding:3px 4px;border:0;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#202423);font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;cursor:pointer}.ds-swatch-circle{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#bed8cc;color:var(--swatch-check,#202423);flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #00000008}.ds-swatch[aria-pressed=true] .ds-swatch-circle{outline:2px solid #3c5a4b;outline-offset:4px}.ds-swatch svg{width:16px;height:16px}.ds-swatch:hover .ds-swatch-circle{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--color-fog,#e6e7e9)}.ds-swatch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbor,#315845);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contact text field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "A labelled white field with neutral hairline, 16px type and a forest focus outline.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">이름<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"text\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--ink,#202423);font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.ds-input{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);min-height:48px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--color-fog,#e6e7e9);border-radius:12px;background:var(--snow,#fff);color:var(--ink,#202423);font-size:16px;font-weight:400;caret-color:var(--harbor,#315845)}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--color-fog,#e6e7e9)}.ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--color-deep-wave,#3e6b52)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbor,#315845);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Featured product information",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "product-information",
      "description": "The flat information portion of the featured product, without invented price or specification data.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-product\"><h3>Himawari No.0422</h3><p>민트</p><a href=\"/product.html?id=store-11070824181\">가방 자세히 보기</a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-product{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);padding:clamp(24px,4vw,52px);border-radius:28px;background:#f7f7f9;color:var(--ink,#202423);box-shadow:none}.ds-product h3{margin:0;font-size:clamp(26px,2.5vw,34px);font-weight:620;line-height:1.35}.ds-product p{color:#616163;font-size:16px;line-height:1.78}.ds-product a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:10px 18px;border:1px solid #d4d7d4;border-radius:999px;background:var(--snow,#fff);color:var(--ink,#202423);font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}.ds-product a:hover{border-color:var(--harbor,#315845)}.ds-product a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbor,#315845);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-product{padding:24px}.ds-product h3{font-size:26px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mint app shortcut",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "app-shortcut",
      "description": "A labelled finder shortcut with the implemented mint gradient and inline Phosphor compass.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-shortcut\" href=\"/finder.html\"><span class=\"ds-app-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm0,192a88,88,0,1,1,88-88A88.1,88.1,0,0,1,128,216ZM172.42,72.84l-64,32a8.05,8.05,0,0,0-3.58,3.58l-32,64A8,8,0,0,0,80,184a8.1,8.1,0,0,0,3.58-.84l64-32a8.05,8.05,0,0,0,3.58-3.58l32-64a8,8,0,0,0-10.74-10.74ZM138,138,97.89,158.11,118,118l40.15-20.07Z\"/></svg></span><span>가방 찾기</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-shortcut{font-family:var(--font-brand,\"Pretendard Local\",\"Pretendard Variable\",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#505153;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.ds-app-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#d6ece0,#9ac6b1);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 1px #ffffff80,0 3px 8px #2024230a;color:var(--ink,#202423)}.ds-app-icon svg{width:27px;height:27px}.ds-shortcut:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbor,#315845);outline-offset:4px;}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-shortcut:hover .ds-app-icon{filter:brightness(.97)}.ds-shortcut:active{transform:scale(.97)}}@media(max-width:1180px){.ds-app-icon{width:52px;height:52px}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-app-icon{width:56px;height:56px}}@media(max-width:370px){.ds-app-icon{width:52px;height:52px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Choose a Colour, Meet the Bag",
    "overview": "White space, original Himawari photography and the bags' varied colours carry the public brand. Visitors can recognise a real model and colour before opening its current product information. Dark, compact actions and consistent rounded icon controls keep the photography prominent. The official logo and established Korean brand statement remain identity assets.\n\nThe approved direction combines photo-led presentation with Apple-like capsules and rounded-square controls. Use the implemented Phosphor SVG family, original product proportions and short Korean labels. Colour is a product discovery cue; the action hierarchy remains stable as the selected bag changes.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White canvas and real, uncropped product imagery.",
      "A fresh catalogue model on each visit, followed by that model's valid colour choices.",
      "Dark actions, readable Korean type and restrained neutral surfaces.",
      "Capsule navigation, rounded-square utility controls and labelled colour choices.",
      "Small, product-linked pastel surfaces rather than full-page colour skins.",
      "Existing catalogue, shopping and content flows carried into the new visual system."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Real Colour Rule",
        "body": "Change the selected photo, label, selected state and detail destination together after the image has decoded; never tint a bag photograph with CSS.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stable Action Rule",
        "body": "Keep the primary action dark when the product colour changes. Use a text label and a check or outline with selected swatches so colour is never the sole signal.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use no shadow for ordinary product cards or primary buttons. Reserve the named soft shadows for their existing components rather than making every rounded surface float.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the white canvas, original logo and actual catalogue photographs to establish the brand.",
      "Do keep the product model, photo, colour label, selected state and product destination in sync.",
      "Do use dark primary actions, labelled SVG controls and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do expose all eight desktop routes directly and preserve their mobile menu destinations.",
      "Do preserve the bag's full shape with contained product imagery and reserved image space.",
      "Do keep utility targets at least 44px and redesigned small labels at least 12px.",
      "Do respect reduced motion and preserve honest loading, error and empty states.",
      "Do retain current catalogue, commerce, account and published-content contracts when extending the interface."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't restore the former full-page sage canvas or hard offset action shadows on redesigned public surfaces.",
      "Don't recolour product photography or describe interface swatches as measured physical colours.",
      "Don't change the primary action's meaning or colour hierarchy for each selected bag.",
      "Don't substitute invented claims, prices, stock, specifications or customer experiences for missing data.",
      "Don't use generated editorial or AI lookbook scenes as factual sales photographs; retain their disclosure.",
      "Don't make emoji, text glyphs or extracted Apple symbols the interface icon system.",
      "Don't propagate inherited eyebrows or overly tight section-heading tracking as new system rules.",
      "Don't reintroduce the removed story pencil cursor or trail effect."
    ]
  }
}
